  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'KaiTi', fontSize: 140, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#A8351A', lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: 10 }}>悲凉</Text>

    <Box style={{ width: 84, height: 3, background: '#1A1A1A', opacity: 0.8, marginTop: 26, marginBottom: 34 }} />

    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', lineHeight: 1.6, textAlign: 'center' }}>
      本是让人难受的，他为什么说——<br />愿意用寿命的三分之二去换？
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 40 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 44, background: 'rgba(168,53,26,0.55)', marginRight: 16 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'KaiTi', fontSize: 24, color: '#3F4A55', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>这北国的秋天，若留得住的话……</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 22, height: 22, background: '#A8351A', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'KaiTi', fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F7F4EC' }}>秋</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 14, color: '#3F4A55' }}>故都的秋 · 郁达夫</Text>
